## NVIDIA Maxine SDK

This software uses the NVIDIA Maxine VideoFX SDK, which is subject to NVIDIA's 
proprietary license terms. By using this software, you agree to comply with the NVIDIA Maxine SDK License Agreement.

Key terms of the NVIDIA Maxine SDK license:
- The SDK is licensed for use only on systems with NVIDIA GPUs
- Redistribution of SDK components (binary form) is permitted
- Applications must include NVIDIA branding attribution

NVIDIA Maxine is a trademark of NVIDIA Corporation.

