## Third-Party Components

- **OpenCV** — Apache License 2.0
- **PySide6** — LGPL v3
- **TensorRT** — NVIDIA proprietary license
- **cuDNN** — NVIDIA proprietary license
- **Maxine C++ headers** (`app/third_party/`) — MIT License, Copyright (c)
  2021 NVIDIA Corporation, from
  [NVIDIA-Maxine/Maxine-VFX-SDK](https://github.com/NVIDIA-Maxine/Maxine-VFX-SDK)
- **DNN face detector model** (`app/models/`) — distributed alongside
  OpenCV's own official `samples/dnn/face_detector`

See [README.md](README.md#third-party-components) for the full picture of
how these fit together, including why the proprietary SDK binaries
themselves are never redistributed from this repository.
